": "ss2.png", "id": "421888538948247", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982542_421888542281580_7961047171456036679_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tUG-as4CQAAQ7kNvwG3owLm&_nc_oc=AdrLvdhmzprjiP8MLsnqm63nrJTAUaa2r2HjgcAkPPvGunLu-GFwUB6kc_VjPlaYqxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSjV9rr5PagIy5ZO8UJy9MSnQ88doqe4wJwRIbZdBt-Ew&oe=6B086A62"}, {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "900672037137096", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569452_900672040470429_3602208668542724751_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wInLIxGQjjsQ7kNvwFcbE00&_nc_oc=Adq30wD-RP1sbyGHwQVgjOlXzeRg00pM0ZZxHgH51VupNWxxSGsqHD8KwAsrPftYnCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTJnqqhhS1y1SrgGJu5yN0098S3Xz_FzDmWU10JL3ZIKg&oe=6B0851B6"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "215595850179052", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036702_215595853512385_1516722769013058759_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mP7UYFJby14Q7kNvwEoE9JH&_nc_oc=Adr0i2UN1bEFzJ2tq9LupBHDN5mQJCF1v0XeB_TDUCcV1ICgPEeEPXXX_7_pKQ2BDIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7LaB_dIhyqyiIDGCu31eYWgpsbQWtYisvmm7NO7JaeQ&oe=6B085924"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "416146802772950", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982521_416146806106283_7161111592696257607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NuK737fW9rQQ7kNvwHxzlo6&_nc_oc=Adq6OZ3s3IVru7Aov9XvXLBVu7EXEjJ-u6_ig9dWQe3hiBJCnlyzGYJKJanRu1CNDV0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTNpdPPNHUACnrwvaDvbz9_CxzWQgXgUfj69-6-g4CGLQ&oe=6B083E90"}, {"file_name": "ss7.png", "id": "512472986379303", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_512472989712636_7638735751378089066_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CIOvIjk8_u4Q7kNvwFjipfZ&_nc_oc=Adrb95_OJLbw7s4E_Nq-XH5SvjUjAepWplPYp2pG669g5VLyE3SR0CWtXxt7tOQuyJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR1HpYJSQ43f8T61xQn3Td9iM9SumwsDwR939FWx-uHLA&oe=6B087161"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MShPr58K_Y0Q7kNvwG3PGXb&_nc_oc=AdpWnZyEVaJt_d-Jd0wI97obwgtCnNGqR8xMqXkuFjPm9nkdADDB5xm6vEe55tdSNfE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZ04NP9BmUkY9cXK4w9Dqb-nDYHh7HxXmcY3ACYNt1iw&oe=6B085C1E"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6jyTsySSmK8Q7kNvwEIKVa5&_nc_oc=AdrYk9zC1W_MWddUXh2cjDjway-9FPlDoBYHHLW5nWVpHJ4ILUWXu-2y7QG_kEfXuMQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSCqb1vO0RNQ0dUNeAIhJHJnBvGpWQEq68S7XUGTFVS-A&oe=6B0871BB"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bD91g_pAkN4Q7kNvwEdo8Ty&_nc_oc=AdopLmWwPFgVyYpLnc9qmFgUoe0rJG4ktYR4g5cmOOYieYjtSr5h08r2DavNfAtpkks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSklJ2lZVlihSA2wqLXeeQO4FM4jS8rmIvVkPCqGyGQsQ&oe=6B085DE1"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xWE34iNhjRQQ7kNvwHMD6Mm&_nc_oc=AdqB-5yT02OtcojlmEQoMDaXzJTXr_8AUDXBu2k4cfA2nfOU0u9dhtvqx4a7o9Ufrlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRStSIGPm7N8FwIQ7yK38Ce8OZZhOb58vVJ